Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:24:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1056/1265] The staff on white pages; Full screen at the end of
 its row

1062 (Viktor): the score's staff, in the panel and full screen, on white paper
with black ink in every theme, as printed; the Full screen button moves to the
end of the score's row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css      |   3 +++
 tools/console/index.html   |   2 +-
 tools/public/index.html.gz | Bin 348450 -> 348562 bytes
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index fa75ddb..fb8f9da 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -2484,3 +2484,6 @@ select option, select optgroup { background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink); }
 .pj-cap { font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
 .pj-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; }
 .pj-head span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
+
+/* HERESY 1062 (Viktor): the staff on white pages, as printed, in every theme and full screen */
+#scoreStaff.paper, .hz-paper { --paper: #ffffff; --paper-ink: #111111; --paper-line: #d0d0d0; background: #fff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #e4e4e4; }
diff --git a/tools/console/index.html b/tools/console/index.html
index 14b676d..b3ea298 100644
--- a/tools/console/index.html
+++ b/tools/console/index.html
@@ -737,10 +737,10 @@ Q6_K · 2.9 GB, Q5_K_M · 2.6 GB · smaller, less VRAM"></select>
               <select class="mp3-rate" id="staffPrintOrient" aria-label="Letter orientation" data-tip="US Letter: portrait or landscape">
                 <option value="portrait">Letter ▯</option><option value="landscape">Letter ▭</option>
               </select></span>
-            <button type="button" class="btn ghost small" id="staffFull" data-tip="The staff over the whole screen: zoom and scroll (or double-click the staff)">⤢ Full screen</button>
             <button type="button" class="btn ghost small" id="takeMidi" data-tip="The score as a MIDI file: tempo, meter, key, a track per voice and the sections as markers, for a DAW">MIDI</button>
             <button type="button" class="btn ghost small" id="takeMarkers" data-tip="The sections (% verse …) as a marker list in seconds (CSV, as Reaper imports it)">Markers</button>
             <button class="btn ghost small" id="reuseScore">Edit and re-render</button>
+            <button type="button" class="btn ghost small" id="staffFull" data-tip="The staff over the whole screen: zoom and scroll (or double-click the staff)">⤢ Full screen</button>
           </div>
           <!-- HERESY 1028: the score checked as YuE2's own dialect, with its numbers (heresy-score.js) -->
           <div class="score-check" id="takeScoreCheck" hidden></div>
